Experimental Motion Control adds timed A→B→C gimbal moves, smoothing, countdown and Pause/Resume/Stop. New false-color choices: CineStop, EL Zone and six-zone IRE. ND assist adds a movable chip with Stops, ND32 and ND 0.3 readouts. Expanded FORMAT choices include more resolutions, frame rates and aspect ratios, plus Pocket 3 2.7K.
